  'Decklare':{name:'Decklare',sub:'Retaliatory',M:0,MText:'-?',dynamicM:true,e1:'Avenging Attack: Drop this card and one card from your hand. You and the player that attacked you this turn must each draw 1 card. You must declare its card type (Numeral/Action/Area). If the opponent received the same type, you each gain 3 MP. If the opponent received the wrong type, they must discard that card and lose 3 MP while you gain 3 MP.',e2:'Sabatoric Draw: Mill 1 card. You and the player that attacked you this turn must each draw 1 card. You must declare its card type (Numeral/Action/Area). If the opponent received the same type, you each gain 3 MP. If the opponent received the wrong type, they must discard that card and lose 3 MP while you gain 3 MP.'},
