  'Neo Orchestral Star':{name:'Neo Orchestral Star',sub:'Advantageous',M:4,isStar:true,starType:'neo',e1:'Drop this card and one card from your Deadzone, and return a card from your Discard to your Deck. Look at the top 5 cards of target player’s Deck. Cede 1 and place the rest back in any order you see fit.',e2:'Dead Draw: Drop this card and one card from your Deadzone, and return a card from your Discard to your Deck. Look at the top 5 cards of target player’s Deck. Send one to the bottom of their Deck, cede another, and place the rest back in any order you see fit.'},
