  'Encore Star':{name:'Encore Star',sub:'Advantageous',M:3,isStar:true,starType:'generic',e1:'Cede this card and mill 1 card. All Numerals on your Battlefield may attack again this turn.',e2:'Dead Draw: Return 1 card from your hand, Discard and Deadzone to your Deck. If all 3 returned cards were of the same class/type, you may counterattack your opponent this turn.'},
